## Benefits of This Refactoring

| Aspect | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| **Reusability** | Benchmark logic embedded | `benchmark()` function |
| **Maintainability** | Harder to modify | Easy to extend |
| **Testability** | Hard to test in isolation | Can test `benchmark()` alone |
| **Code Clarity** | Mixed concerns | Clear separation |
| **Scalability** | Limited | Easy to add more algorithms |

This refactored version maintains all the original functionality while improving code organization and maintainability through the extraction of the benchmark logic into a reusable function.
